<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>选题背景 · 课程复习中的三个断点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>02 · Topic</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 62, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>核心问题：能否把「课程」作为一等对象，让智能体在真实备考流程中持续可用？</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 340, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 18 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>真实备考场景的三个断点</Text><Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 90, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>01</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>课程上下文缺失</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>通用聊天工具不区分课程，每次提问都要重新交代教材、进度与薄弱点。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 90, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', marginTop: 10 }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>02</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>资料难以沉淀</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>课件、作业、错题散落在本地与聊天记录里，无法形成可复用的复习上下文。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 90, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', marginTop: 10 }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>03</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>复习缺少闭环</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>计划靠手工安排，错题录入、错因诊断、变式练习与掌握确认彼此断开。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>期望的复习链路</Text><Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}><Box style={{ width: 400, height: 62, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 36 }}>01</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 190 }}>课件与资料</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 150 }}>按课程上传</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 400, height: 62, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: 10, marginTop: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 36 }}>02</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 190 }}>提问与总结</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 150 }}>带上下文</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 400, height: 62, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: 10, marginTop: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 36 }}>03</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 190 }}>错题与计划</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 150 }}>沉淀复用</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 400, height: 62, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', padding: 10, marginTop: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 36 }}>04</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 190 }}>到点提醒</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, width: 150 }}>闭环收口</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 46, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>背景结论：学习上下文必须按课程被系统记住，而不是靠用户每次重新输入。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>07 / 28</Text></Box></Slide>